<p>For context as to its creation: I dislike SCP-1800. That's pretty much the impetus.</p>
<p>edit: SHIT. credit to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sandrewswann" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(469313); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=469313&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1573241910" alt="sandrewswann" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=469313)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sandrewswann" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(469313); return false;">sandrewswann</a></span> for sections carried over from 1800's text, which was heavily consulted in 1168's creation. I apologize for the tardiness on this; I thought the mere mention of 1800 would've been sufficient credit, as it was a textual source, but I'm going to make this more explicit because it needs to be.</p>

